tion\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 vae/\n│   │   ├── minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n│   │   └── minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   └── minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 unet/\n│   │   └── minimax_h3_fl2va-XX_X_X.gguf\n│   └── 📂 text_encoders/\n│       └── qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors\n```\n"},"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":131,"type":"MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo","pos":[-2320,5260],"size":[1000,1170],"flags":{},"order":22,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":301},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":241},{"localized_name":"first_frame","name":"first_frame","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":275},{"localized_name":"last_frame","name":"last_frame","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":286},{"localized_name":"prompt","name":"prompt","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"prompt"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"width","name":"width","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"width"},"link":270},{"localized_name":"height","name":"height","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"height"},"link":245},{"localized_name":"length","name":"length","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"length"},"link":243}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"positive","name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[237]},{"localized_name":"LATENT","name":"LATENT","type":"LATENT","links":[235]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.30.0","Node name for S&R":"MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"width":true,"height":true,"length":true},"version":"7.7","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["Family-friendly 10-second video. One continuous locked-off shot, no cuts, no camera movement.\n\nFIRST FRAME:\nA pretty adult woman sits on a park bench in a sunny realistic park. She is wearing casual clothing with fitted jeans worn over cowboy boots. She holds a sandwich in one hand and looks down with a warm smile at one funny-looking stylized animated bird sitting beside her on the bench. The woman is fully realistic and the environment is fully realistic. The bird is colorful, expressive, and clearly animated. Bright natural daylight, soft breeze, cheerful mood.\n\nACTION BEATS:\n0.0–2.0 sec:\nThe woman looks at the bird and smiles warmly. The bird stares at the sandwich, excited and hungry, and begins doing little happy jumps up and down on the bench.\n\n2.0–4.5 sec:\nThe woman breaks off a small piece of the sandwich and gently feeds it to the bird. The bird happily takes the piece and eats it with quick eager movements.\n\n4.5–6.5 sec:\nAfter swallowing, the bird becomes very happy, bobs with excitement, then gives a loud cheerful whistle call toward the air as if calling friends.\n\n6.5–9.0 sec:\nFive more similar animated birds quickly fly into frame and land around the woman — on the bench backrest, beside her, and one lightly on her shoulder — all looking at her sandwich expectantly. Their motion is playful and friendly, not chaotic.\n\n9.0–10.0 sec:\nThe woman laughs naturally, looks at the little crowd of birds, and says, “Okay!” in an amused friendly tone.\n\nAUDIO:\nLight park ambience, soft bird chirps, one clear whistle call from the first bird, gentle wing flutters as the other birds arrive, the woman gives a natural laugh and clearly says, “Okay!”\n\nSTYLE / MOTION NOTES:\nKeep the shot wholesome, charming, and family-friendly. Real woman, real park atmosphere, animated birds only. Natural facial expressions, smooth motion, no slapstick chaos, no aggression, no surreal distortion.",1344,768,73],"widgets_values_named":{"prompt":"Family-friendly 10-second video. One continuous locked-off shot, no cuts, no camera movement.\n\nFIRST FRAME:\nA pretty adult woman sits on a park bench in a sunny realistic park. She is wearing casual clothing with fitted jeans worn over cowboy boots. She holds a sandwich in one hand and looks down with a warm smile at one funny-looking stylized animated bird sitting beside her on the bench. The woman is fully realistic and the environment is fully realistic. The bird is colorful, expressive, and clearly animated. Bright natural daylight, soft breeze, cheerful mood.\n\nACTION BEATS:\n0.0–2.0 sec:\nThe woman looks at the bird and smiles warmly. The bird stares at the sandwich, excited and hungry, and begins doing little happy jumps up and down on the bench.\n\n2.0–4.5 sec:\nThe woman breaks off a small piece of the sandwich and gently feeds it to the bird. The bird happily takes the piece and eats it with quick eager movements.\n\n4.5–6.5 sec:\nAfter swallowing, the bird becomes very happy, bobs with excitement, then gives a loud cheerful whistle call toward the air as if calling friends.\n\n6.5–9.0 sec:\nFive more similar animated birds quickly fly into frame and land around the woman — on the bench backrest, beside her, and one lightly on her shoulder — all looking at her sandwich expectantly. Their motion is playful and friendly, not chaotic.\n\n9.0–10.0 sec:\nThe woman laughs naturally, looks at the little crowd of birds, and says, “Okay!” in an amused friendly tone.\n\nAUDIO:\nLight park ambience, soft bird chirps, one clear whistle call from the first bird, gentle wing flutters as the other birds arrive, the woman gives a natural laugh and clearly says, “Okay!”\n\nSTYLE / MOTION NOTES:\nKeep the shot wholesome, charming, and family-friendly. Real woman, real park atmosphere, animated birds only. Natural facial expressions, smooth motion, no slapstick chaos, no aggression, no surreal distortion.","width":1344,"height":768,"length":73},"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":124,"type":"BasicScheduler","pos":[-2170,4840],"size":[280,110],"flags":{},"order":23,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":300},{"localized_name":"scheduler","name":"scheduler","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"scheduler"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"steps","name":"steps","type":"INT","widget":{"name":